<title>JAPAN: Kyowa Hakko - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kyowa Hakko - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		165.80		vs	   75.09</p>
<p> Operating	   12.21		vs	    4.69</p>
<p> Current	     12.80		vs	    4.29</p>
<p> Net		    5.03		vs	    1.79</p>
