<p> Shares	    446 million	  vs	 446 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    1.90 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyowa Hakko Kogyo Co Ltd's last term is a three</p>
<p>months term.</p>
